    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f24894cf3c785b4ed8244b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的弯道位于前方时\n持续一段时间稍微提升速度\n<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb14d11651a100d281eec97fb3a53f23dcc3478c32d9cf1d570def2ee845b480",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0c36a3b2628dc2f2805801",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的弯道位于前方时\n持续一段时间略微提升速度\n<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f189d0cdda495e41824f71980ae6bf79603a1476089a0c6511e71e19d7259eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79bfbf4823be65cd00ef8f95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘且剩余不足600m时\n位于领放或试图在前方超越时\n提升加速度<领放/先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "adce3a2eb382ae665e805cb2d6444e7caa1a706ec6f6e7434aa81a7cd12f23ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e53166f932e52294aa790fcd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘剩余600m以内时\n位于领头或在前方试图超越时\n稍微提升加速度<领放/先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c2668e9023d17ddcf054b01205031b4ad568d56a713c43de606917dc2959388",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26dc57833654c0faabe60960",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终阶段开始时\\n若处于最后冲刺中则提升速度\\n＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "290929da34895d993e64352b83bb8ad4964e99e15bf0fdd19a5def95f9c45618",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eec86a0d2c07c3bced11c0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段中\n速度略微提升<英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f47e67cca5b5eedfceea16dbd1d6929c89e0ccaa70070e262651e086328a62a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44df59bc0a1e112eda6a7e16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘进行超越或处于领头位置时\n速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "79ca3e5160cd817bb1213a4c37c92667aecba2d86e7370c2a9521cb5b4891db1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c730925e9faf9a2850f9fc06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘进行超越或处于领头位置时\n速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "df3177dd823310be0f422d4be074abfde43c0ed420954f64fa0c9d96bb19ac84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dfbeae32a780d6ff93cd8a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘\n一段时间内速度少量提升\n＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d088f0a5c863f34c41dbe39141adc729937e925aae3e9313aa12100b51b1c490",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5adaa07d56c0b76be1a41e8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘\n一段时间内速度略微提升\n＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbeda089617fe15506681f7d1a86a778b86f81fd79a9b5544268488648e3f8b3",
