    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d50406fda142c11b1e736f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度和力量充分高时\n速度和力量略微提升\n<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d29242e159c0af4cc0d4342fa0606de9454fa7f83e14ddd53337436c9a87fe7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d150cd3180325a90ba4edc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若位于前方\n一段时间内速度少量提升\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bba8c3069086f08a1eef6f7832f2dadbb5d0cc3f59c24b4db54ede679d2db690",
