        "204351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48bc2854b5045e1c9d40629",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的弯道上处于中间集团及以后时\n一段时间内速度小幅提升\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b406e84a8885be855687d41e0e3bac064650e52fe537e2f8fac71e45b1ef2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a681081231b767541a4375f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘消耗少量体力\n并稍微提升速度\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a42f2a51404931679bbfb978774be3d73ccd0721a7e7c186bfe3c2eaf805e2e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486ec3d12398b5781d9018fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时\n速度稍微提升\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fc4029a6ba04db0caa35cf74553bb4e6856178d3b27c26d6f735b55dc9bf3ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ceafdb4f2d85058b5fe6c52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段向前突进＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b87e1cda39ac238bb4bb2b86a9900f4da17b22934489f21c15946a02e757229e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f19a5356ae8eb268f51e2efe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段稍微向前突进\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "749ab2b9642926f3840ba6e5f7c67b7374faa49aabe01354f0da21b97ccddef9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad22c9f8a3331fb90cf6079",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时回复耐力\\n并稍微向前突进＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "93a1d39425242370901996f3514bef5ef74fde7465ef586087dd210443357146",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f56676320da3c65e655394",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时极小幅回复耐力\\n并在极短时间内略微向前突进\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5b136f75389f72d94496c7a13815cacefea5ecf42082e63732c9cd7e96dec7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0810a24a4d691dbc48524350",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最强的斗志今日也隐藏在花影之中\\n将聚光灯让给女王，力量稍微下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "14942f5de668ae08d575ccd7997179dbb185fe93fe57edea0dd50126600a9b78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae3e081bf76d997972fdd4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期处于前方时\\n速度微幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d264d14b7eb8426248684524bb9e60dd6d40bc0b3d535f6b8c9a8f65759cfea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e096980221f5f97d76bbab94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "寒冰绽放的光辉中摇曳着一抹鲜红\\n将獠牙隐匿于暗影之中，力量略微下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "37ec5fbf70cb47a9dd79f6d6c49e9e1c734bbc9a1e5549c9af4c3ea9b4091b64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8364ae052f169c2f1b38ee94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若处于最后冲刺中\\n则在直线上提升加速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "17cdf3cfb4feb4e801bb9e7c169fb508e0a077356f5f405db04a563c6f413b6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a2323b65c6242df23824921",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若处于最后冲刺中\\n则在直线上稍微提升加速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e8f38c62abd5adf65be8298ea9f0a1e90467dd6a8b8b850b940411f465a031e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204432"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2df6f6806a6779c017de94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度稍微提升\\n若距离第一名6马身以上\\n则速度提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1baa971e596c05989eda01472ed696832e91f205465a8e917d40e20667e2ed4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204442"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770472785cd40623271dd5c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时稍微降低速度\\n若一直保持在中团及以后位置\\n则不降低速度转而提升速度\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "afa3bc278b82523ab7ffa97c07739c2eb455ea399ec95b55351190bebf4dcacc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204452"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f92e845fc6c7dfd0d1039a08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时\\n速度稍微提升\\n若一直保持在中团及以后位置\\n则速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "12a81be4ce3d63c886bcedd32345af54c8563119d196a49735fe06abf388264a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204453"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fb45a56d354814c81c32e7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即将进入中盘时\\n若位于中团及以后则速度稍微提升\\n＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "48819df37b05d80d21805043a217bc58168d532ab59c2507c8b0c32801cc8a63",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b58d837ba564db358c42939",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前的第3弯道若位于前方\\n则稍微向前突进\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e966bed9c07494a11e08aee789cdd4a68d539af4f050a10b2d991d860648b19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204472"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17350c96f295525927703494",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n速度提升＜领放・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d132fa6a9ba5ed7c7a56ef98359f74e94a00eb05fa4a56a1bd8238df979d7fe5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
